        "searchField": "selected.fillet tristan-huber fillet the only the selected edges of an assembly. you can also input face or sub-assembly selections, edges will be filleted if they meet any of the selection criteria, eg on a selected subassembly, on a selected face. default fillets all edges. abundance-tool",
        "owner": "tristan-huber",
        "description": "Fillet the only the selected edges of an assembly. You can also input face or sub-assembly selections, edges will be filleted if they meet any of the selection criteria, eg on a selected subassembly, on a selected face. Default fillets all edges.",
        "contentURL": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tristan-huber/selected.Fillet/master/project.abundance?sanitize=true",
